    "body": "Explore the lesson here. Canvas holds your check-ins, submissions, feedback, and progress.\nReturn to this lesson\nA practical course by Majid Memari\nBuilding\nAI Solutions.\nFind a real need. Build a useful solution.\nTest it. Bring it to users.\nPractical AI problem-solving for everyone. Students from any discipline can build useful solutions with evidence, numbers, and real decisions. No prerequisites: no prior AI, programming, or business background required.\nStart with Unit 1 →12 units · one capstone · five milestones\n\nYour project, taking shape\n01A need worth solvingPeople · evidence · a bounded task\n\n02A solution someone can useAI assistance · human judgment\n\n03A decision you can defendTest results · value · next steps\n\nEvery lesson adds to the same project.One path from start to finish"
