    "body": "Select a bounded partner task or Cedar Desk. Identify the user, approved information, responsible decision owner, and feedback windows.\nPublish the calendar, team size, submission location, actual weights, access arrangements, and feedback timing. Twelve units are not twelve mandatory weeks.\nConfirm approved tools and costs. Provide the supplied-output fallback so paid AI access is not required.\nRead the complete example and five rubrics. Test the ordinary, incomplete, and exception tasks before assigning them."
